THEME TRAP worth remembering: accent.yellow.bg is 'bg-amber-50/50' — a LIGHT
amber even in the DARK theme. Muted slate text on it is invisible. The Eagle
Scout chip uses literal amber-400/amber-950 rather than the ramp. Check the
actual value before assuming a dark-theme token is dark.

SIDE BEAMS: presence is bought with blade WIDTH and OPACITY, not count.
Width is nearly free; each extra blade composites over two live canvases in
overlay mode. Current: 6 blades, 2.2-5.5vw, opacity 0.62, spread 86deg, 60fps.

FIND ME: label is absolutely centred OVER the icon row so hover swaps one for
the other in place and the pill never resizes.
